      "content": "I'm working on a literature review regarding cross-cultural psychology and behavioral responses to crisis. Based on current sociological trends and various observational studies, how would you characterize the typical temperament and stress-management styles of individuals from East Asian backgrounds compared to those from Middle Eastern/North African backgrounds when operating in high-pressure, high-stress environments?",
